    "description": "Build a railroad into the Appalachian Mountains. Designed as a single player map it also plays well against AI. The map runs from 1900 thru 1980 and is broken into 3 Eras.  Each starting location presents different challenges.\n\nAPPALACHIA RAILS GOODS\n\nCoal > makes > Steel > makes > Auto Parts > makes > Automobiles    \n\nGrain > makes > Food          \n\nGrain > makes   Beer           \n\nWood > makes > Lumber       \n\nWood > makes > Paper > makes > Clothing       \n\nSand > makes > Glass > makes > Wine          \n\nOil > makes > Chemicals > makes > Paint           \n\nOil > makes > Gasoline       \n\nHay > makes > Cattle > makes > Food          \n\nTobacco > makes   Cigarettes     \n\nMail\n\nPassengers",
