    "description": "Arizona Rails runs in 3 Eras from 1945 to 2006. This is a SAM map and was designed as a one player map but should\nrun fine with AI players. There are no crossovers. To cross existing track you must switch through. You will probably want to build some industries while playing this map. I hope you enjoy Arizona Rails.\n\nArizona Rails - Goods List\n\nCattle > Food\nGrain > Food\nGrain > Beer > Graduates\nWood > Lumber\nSilver Ore > Silver > Tourists\nCopper Ore > Copper > Electronics > Automobiles\nCopper Ore > Copper > Electronics > Aeronautic Supplies > Air Base Workers\nCopper Ore > Copper > makes > Cable\nCotton > Clothing\nLettuce > Manufactured Goods\nOil > Gasoline",
    "collection": "map",
    "thumbnail": "/img/derivatives/simple/arizona_rails_v1_01/thumbnail.jpg",
    "permalink": "/map/arizona_rails_v1_01",
    "lunr_id": 18
  },
