    "modified_by": "snoopy55",
    "description": "Greece, a land of mountains and the sea. Of myths and legends, ancient knowledge. But time moves on and after a hard-fought independence from the Ottoman Empire, Greece needs to modernize. Starting with the home province of Attica, the Greek railroad system is key to developing the country. From industry to urbanisation to tourism, railroads throughout the region transport goods and passengers to a bright future. \n\nSINGLE PLAYER ONLY! Exceeds limit on locations for play against AI.\nThis is a large map. To stave off freezing, a result of the game being pushed near its limits, engine speeds have been raised. This reduces number of engines and track mileage needed. As a single player map, patents have been disabled.",
    "collection": "map",
    "thumbnail": "/img/derivatives/simple/attica5_v1_00/thumbnail.jpg",
