  {
    "pid": "austrian_hungarian_monarchy_v1_00",
    "label": "Austrian Hungarian Monarchy SAM",
    "created": "2009/07/30",
    "updated": "2009/07/30",
    "author": "Jancsika",
    "description": "The rise and fall of the Austrian Hungarian Monarchy  1867 _1919 \nIf you are interested in history here is a Wiki link http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austria-Hungary\nThe map is a 15X15 SAM. 96 turns_month.\nThe names of the cities are from a contemporary Rand McNally map, many of them changed several times during the span of the past 100 years.\nThere are three Eras, with three different scenario goals. It will be necessary to rearrange the rail lines.\nThe third Era is: World War I. It is a rather short timespan, five years _I changed it from 4_ so you have to be prepared for the switch. Be sure to have empty building slots to _build a War industry_.\nThere are 32 goods, that is the maximum allowed and it will slow down towards the game at the end.\nYou will not have to worry about enough money. The mail traffic will take care of it. Once the production of the other goods is sufficient, I would delete the Mail trains to free up the tracks for the industry traffic.",
