    "pid": "four_corners_v1_00",
    "label": "Four Corners SAM",
    "created": "2011/06/26",
    "updated": "2011/06/26",
    "author": "Slider38",
    "modified_by": "STEP Inc",
    "description": "The Old Timer asks, So you want to be a railroad tycoon ehh?  Well, you better be ready for a rough go of it pilgrim.  We need to get some industry started here.  Oh we've got some resources for sure, just waitin' for a fella with deep pockets to come along and get things goin'.  Is that you?\n\t\t\t\t\t\nYour competitors don't think so.  They figure you for a tenderfoot come west to make an easy fortune.  Ain't nothun easy out here boy!  We've got things besides resources - there's outlaws, mountains, deserts and snow.  You best get your gandy dancers crackin', for you get left in the dust.  Good luck sonny.",
    "collection": "map",
    "thumbnail": "/img/derivatives/simple/four_corners_v1_00/thumbnail.jpg",
    "permalink": "/map/four_corners_v1_00",
    "lunr_id": 59
