  {
    "pid": "fourbears_v1_00",
    "label": "FourBears",
    "created": "2015/10/25",
    "updated": "2015/10/25",
    "author": "Jancsika",
    "modified_by": "Jancsika",
    "description": "This magic land is guarded by four gigantic bears.\nYour goal is first to connect all cities, then develop the iron and steel industries and collect a lot of money. All cargo production requires Workers. Workers are available in the towns in cities but not in excess. In each era, you must direct the workforce to focus on different industries. \n-----------------------------------------SINGLE-PLAYER-ONLY------------------------------------\nInfo: All haulage quotas can be met in the era they are given except the final Iron Ore and Automobile ones. Most cargoes have wide price ranges for sharp price drops by mid-game. Net worth levels are for Robber Baron play. \nDesigned to allow play with no overpasses/bridges/tunnels, inactive station tracks avoiding all cross-overs. More info in the readme file.",
    "collection": "map",
    "thumbnail": "/img/derivatives/simple/fourbears_v1_00/thumbnail.jpg",
    "permalink": "/map/fourbears_v1_00",
