    "author": "Mojos",
    "modified_by": "STEP Inc",
    "description": "This modified version of the stock France scenario covers the majority of France and covers the time period 1842-1989.  This scenario begins some 10 years after the world's earliest railways, during the birth of the late-blooming modern French rail system, through the pioneering high-speed TGV.  This scenario is medium difficulty, suitable for more experienced players.",
