    "description": "Welcome to Heart of Texas.  This map is played in 3 Eras from spanning from 1920 to 1980.  The map is designed as a one\nplayer and was tested that way.  Play with AI should not present any problems.  You will probably want to build some industries as you\nplay and there is certainly room for that.  You may want to higher a couple of extra industrial engineers - you will have a number of bridges\nto build. I hope that you enjoy Heart of Texas.",
