    "author": "Snoopy55",
    "modified_by": "STEP Inc",
    "description": "This map was created from Hill Valley Rush. In it you will have to supply the Cattle Ranches and Dairy Farms with Grain and/or Cornmeal.  From there you will take Milk and/or Cattle.  Milk will go to the Fromageries and Cattle to the Stockyards or Tannery.  The Stockyards will supply you with Food and the Tannery with Cowhides.  Cowhides from there and/or Wool from Sheep Farms goes to the Textile Mills which will give you Clothing.",
