  {
    "pid": "holidays_in_ohio_toy_trains_2_v1_00",
    "label": "Holidays in Ohio - Toy Trains SAM2",
    "created": "2009/11/05",
    "updated": "2009/11/05",
    "author": "Lowell",
    "modified_by": "STEP Inc",
    "description": ".................MERRY CHRISTMAS....2009................\nGreedy robber barons are encroaching on Santa's supply chain, taking over local industries, leeching toys that were to be delivered to Santa's Workshop. \nCreate and deliver large quantities of toys and supplies to Santa's Distribution Centers while keeping your competition at bay.\n \nSanta and the children of the world are looking to you to save Christmas!\nElves will increase production for industries in-city, cookies, rocking horses, dolls, teddy bears, toy soldiers, egg-nog.\n\nPassengers will increase production for bulk good industries, wood, coal, sheep, grain, milk.\nVisitors will shop and spend gold in your cities. Export Toys to earn more Gold. \nUse your Gold to buy Bicycles and Train Sets for all cities.\nYou will need to startup the basic industries first. \nOnce the industries have started housing will be provided for the Elves to move in. \nPassengers and Visitors will arive as city growth progresses. \nUse the Holidays_in_Ohio Funds so you have enough money to get started.",
    "collection": "map",
