    "author": "Jancsika",
    "modified_by": "STEP Inc",
    "description": "The Eastern Seaboard of the United States was devastated by a powerful hurricane. You have been given 3 years to restore the damaged fishing industries, then an other 3 years to rebuild the tourist industry in Atlantic City and Ocean City, bring winter sports into the western mountains and revitalize the Washington - New York corridor.",
