  {
    "pid": "lberia_v1_06",
    "label": "Lberia_v1_06.7z",
    "description": "Iberia bridge between continents.\n\nWe are in 1850, and a connection between France and Algeria is required for transporting oil. Yet we first must build a railroad that loops through the Iberian peninsula.\n\nIn the first phase you have to connect four cities, namely, Madrid, Lisbon, Barcelona and Bordeaux. Then create two food companies and transport the resulting food.\n\nIn the second phase we must transport: vehicles from Barcelona, oil from Brest, Brest manufactured goods from Cadiz, and paper from Alicante to Santigo newspaper. You must connect all cities in Africa and cities in northen Iberia: Gijon, Santander and Biarritz. Transport passengers Gijon-Biarritz, and Ouazzane-Barcelona and Argel-Lyon. Transport food from Ouazzane to Oran, Tiaret and Argel. Make Argel a Metropolis. Money: Net worth 75.000.000 pta and 100% share of your company.\n\nINTRODUCTION\n------------\n\nIberia bridge between continents.\n\nWe are in 1850, and required a connection between France and Algeria for transporting oil, but for this we must build a railroad that loops through the Iberian peninsula.\n\nIn the first phase you have to connect four cities, namely, Madrid, Lisbon, Barcelona and Bordeaux, create two food companies and transporting that food.\n\nIn the second phase must carry: vehicles from Barcelona, oil from Brest, Brest manufactured goods from Cadiz and paper from Alicante to Santigo newspaper. You must connect all cities in Africa and cities in northen Iberia: Gijon, Santander and Biarritz. Transport passengers Gijon-Biarritz, and Ouazzane-Barcelona and Argel-Lyon. Transport food from Ouazzane to Oran, Tiaret and Argel. Make Argel a Metropolis. Money: Net worth 75.000.000 pta and 100% share of your company.\n\n\nOBJECTIVE OF THE STAGE.\n-----------------------\n\nThis scenario consists of two phases. 1st Phase: 1850-1880 and 2nd phase: 1881-1970\n\n* First phase 1850-1880.\n\n- Construct two food producing industries, a grain processing and other meat processing.\n- Ship 67 loads of food.\n- Connect these four cities: Lisboa, Madrid, Barcelona, Burdeos.\n\n* Second phase 1881-1965.\n\n- Connect Brest and Argel.\n- Connect North Africa, unite these cities: Larache, Ifran, Ouazzane, Oran, Tiaret and Melilla.\n- Carry 100 cars oil to Brest.\n- Transport 100 manufactured goods from Brest refinery to Cadiz.\n- Transport 200 cars from the factory in Barcelona.\n- Paper transport 65 cars from the Alicante to Santiago newspaper.\n- Connect Gijon, Santander and Biarritz.\n- Make a furniture plant in Gijon\n- Transport manufactured goods from Gijon: 80 to Lisboa and 50 to Marsella.\n- Transport 55 wagons of passengers: Gijon to Biarritz and Biarritz to Gijon.\n- Transport 20 loads of food to Ouazzane to Oran, Argel and Tiaret.\n- Transport 70 loads of passengers from Ouazzane to Barcelona and 55 from Argel to Lyon.\n- Make Argel a Metropolis.\n- Net worth: 75.000.000 pta.\n- 100% of share of your company.\n- Eliminate all competitors.\n\n\nVERSIONS:\n----------\n\n* IBERIA V.1.06\n\nChanged end of game to year 1965\nDeleted third phase.\n* IBERIA V.1.05\n\nChanged end of game to year 2000\nAdded a third phase (1971-2000)\nRemoved 3 locomotives. \n\n\n* IBERIA V.1.04\n\nChanged end of game to year 1970\nReduced net worth to 60.000.000\n\n* IBERIA V.1.03\n\nRetouch orography and paint the map.\nModified objectives.\nReduced some locomotives.\n\n* IBERIA V.1.01\n\nModified with photoshop orography, softening it.\nBrest is located further north.\nSmall change in French rivers.\n\n\n* IBERIA V.1.00\n\nFirst version.\n\n---------------------------\n07/10/2012\n---------------------------",
    "collection": "map",
    "thumbnail": "/img/derivatives/simple/lberia_v1_06/thumbnail.jpg",
    "permalink": "/map/lberia_v1_06",
    "lunr_id": 103
  },
