    "description": "This is  13 x 13 size map.\nThere are 96 turns/month.\nThere are 4 Eras.\nEra 1 Build up your villages to _Large Village_ to be able to build the industries that needed in Era 2\nIf you can, build chemical plant in Hordburg and haul Coal to it to produce Nitrates. That will increase your grain production.\nEra  2 is the more difficult. The production line runs from\n\t\t\tOil fields \n\t\t\tHordburg (Chemical Plant)\n\t\t\tAnnuminas (Medicine to Passengers)\n\t\t\tTaconite Mines\n\t\t\tPelletizer in Baranduin\n\t\t\tIron Mill in Harland\n\t\t\tSteel Mill in Osgiliath\n\t\t\tWar Factory in Farland\n\t\t\tMilitary Fort in Edoras\n\t\t\tMetal Works Factory in Lorien\n\t\t\tBank in Hobbiton\nEra 3 \tCorn Fields\n\t\t\tCattle Ranch\n\t\t\tTannery in Hardbottle\n\t\t\tFootball Manufacturer in Osgiliath\t\n\t\t\tManufactured goods in Linhir\n\t\t\tMetropolises (size 9, 10, 11)to receive Goods\nEra 4 \tPassengers to Linhir, visitors to Hotel and Casino in Farland, gold To Bank in Hobbiton.",
