  {
    "pid": "rift_valley_3_2_v1_00",
    "label": "Rift Valley 3 SAM2",
    "created": "2010/09/17",
    "updated": "2010/09/17",
    "author": "Jancsika",
    "modified_by": "STEP Inc",
    "description": "After the collapse of the lumber and paper industries the country is facing an extreme emergency. \nYou have to build new money making industries. \nThere are raw oil, cotton, and grape productions, but you have to find and build manufacturing plants to utilize them, export them and turning them into gold.Meanwhile the people need to be fed. \nYou have to develop a food distribution system to utilize your existing stockyard and fromagerie.In order to make the industries produce you have to supply them with adequate labor (passengers).\nYou have ten years to achieve this miracle. If you fail you might end up in one of those gulags.",
    "collection": "map",
