  {
    "pid": "seefra3_v1_00",
    "label": "Seefra3 SAM",
    "created": "2018/02/26",
    "updated": "2018/02/26",
    "author": "Star Ranger4 / Railage",
    "modified_by": "Snoopy55",
    "description": "Seefra 3 is cut off from the known worlds. An aspiring tycoon, you find yourself stranded here by some mistake. Technology is frowned upon, but perhaps a functioning rail network will change public opinion.\t\n\tYou find unique constraints. Passengers are produced only by Villages. All city sizes exchange Goods for Passengers. Larger cities have lower rates of exchange. Capzitolia has a Passenger for Passenger exchange at 5:2.\n\tResource production low. All resource buildings are Large at game start. Will degrade in 2025 if unused. In-city industries convert at 2:1.\n\tDesigned for play against 3 AI players. AI players use a special difficulty level.\n\tTrack-laying is cheaper than normal. Use of sensible bridges and tunnels recommended.\n\tTGV included as a prototype, expensive to purchase and run.",
