  {
    "pid": "sodor_v3_0_random_v1_00",
    "label": "Sodor V3.0 Random SAM",
    "created": "2009/07/28",
    "updated": "2009/07/28",
    "author": "Rodea, Jancsika",
    "modified_by": "Jancsika",
    "description": "THERE ARE TROUBLES IN SODOR!!\n\tThere was a greedy railroad tycoon who tried to build some rail lines, but went bankrupt and abandoned the rails and left Thomas and his friends to rust.\n\tYou are given an oil can and moral authority to rebuild this abandoned island.\n\tFirst you have to restore and put Thomas and his friends in working order. \n\tSecond you have to build up the food supply, so that the people are well fed.\n\tYou also have to bring the rails to every community to the island, so that you can can move the goods and workforce around.\n\tOnce the villages are connected you assignment will be to bring prosperity to the land. You have to build up the industry and feed and clothe the people and make money for your backers.(This is Capitalism after all!)",
